doc /* Planned candidate references are not the identity of a built article.
 * Absent article, released procedure and instruments remain unresolved;
 * no execution or evidence-acceptance status is invented. */

// System responsibility allocations for the finite Gorge challenge.
// These assert intended design responsibility, not demonstrated compliance.
satisfy BlueDog::Mission::Challenge::overallLength by missionContext.boat;

// BEGIN GENERATED PROJECTION: current-sizing
